ch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106314.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Partially fixes #106312.\r\n\r\nI've added notes in the descriptions of Projection's get_z_near and get_aspect functions about how they can return negatives values. While testing out more functions, I also realized that get_far_plane_half_extents, get_pixels_per_meter, and get_viewport_half_extents can all also be negative.\r\n\r\nIn 4.4, get_z_near could return a negative and get_pixels_per_meter was always positive, but it seems both of these functions have changed along the way. Just in case these end up being a bug, I've left the descriptions of them alone.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106314/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106314/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}